This repository and the bash-lsp binary include a modified copy of the
package mvdan.cc/sh/v3/syntax (https://github.com/mvdan/sh, commit
0e0eb36bb6dd) in internal/front/syntax, with its printer and simplifier, and
a copy of the function Shebang from the package mvdan.cc/sh/v3/fileutil (same
